{"type":"step-attempt","step":"code-review","sessionId":"319dc68b-620e-42af-83ac-f46566da012c","outcome":{"verdict":"approved","findingsPath":"specrunner/changes/graph-and-check/review-feedback-001.md","error":null,"toolResult":{"ok":true,"approved":true,"findings":[{"severity":"low","resolution":"fixable","file":"src/check/manifest.ts","title":"Direct import from mod-parse in mod-check (dependency direction violation)","rationale":"`import type { ParseResult } from \"../parse/types.ts\"` creates a declared dependency from mod-check to mod-parse that is not listed in design/static/dependencies.md. The allowed path is mod-check → mod-graph → mod-parse only. Because it is a type-only import there is no runtime impact, but the module boundary is violated.","line":8},{"severity":"low","resolution":"fixable","file":"src/check/checker.ts","title":"Unused import: getEnabledLayers","rationale":"`getEnabledLayers` is imported from manifest.ts but never referenced in the function body of `runCheck`. Only `getEnabledPrefixes` and `isLayerEnabled` are actually used.","line":11},{"severity":"low","resolution":"fixable","file":"src/check/rules/c07-manifest-prerequisites.ts","title":"Unused imports: LAYER_ENABLED_NAMES, VIEW_TYPE_NAMES","rationale":"`LAYER_ENABLED_NAMES` and `VIEW_TYPE_NAMES` are imported but never used inside `checkC7`. Only `LAYER_PREREQUISITES` is referenced in the function body.","line":9},{"severity":"low","resolution":"fixable","file":"src/check/rules/c03-ref-resolved.ts","title":"Implicit one-element-per-file assumption and O(n×m) lookup in C3 and C11","rationale":"Both c03-ref-resolved.ts (line 34) and c11-layer-direction.ts (line 39) use `rawElements.find((el) => el.file === ref.file)` to identify the source element for a reference. This is O(n) per reference (O(n×m) total) and silently relies on the strict-profile convention that each file contains exactly one element declaration. The assumption is correct today but is undocumented, making the code fragile for future maintainers.","line":34}],"observations":[{"severity":"low","file":"src/check/rules/c06-view-links.ts","title":"C6 and C7 diagnostics use file='' and line=0","rationale":"Manifest-level rules (C6, C7) produce diagnostics with empty file path and line 0 because the manifest file path is not passed to these rule functions. This is an intentional design trade-off (D4: each rule takes only what it needs); CLI formatting is deferred to the next request. No action required now.","line":27}]},"followUpAttempts":1,"transientRetryAttempts":0},"startedAt":"2026-07-02T04:13:25.786Z","endedAt":"2026-07-02T04:19:16.399Z"}
{"type":"lineage","step":"code-review","ts":"2026-07-02T04:19:16.399Z","outputs":[{"path":"specrunner/changes/graph-and-check/review-feedback-002.md","hash":null}],"inputs":[{"path":"specrunner/changes/graph-and-check/design.md","hash":"sha256:f128e496e367ad4871d7d1e05aed2c949789f24d1e07874e59662efa231d9289"},{"path":"specrunner/changes/graph-and-check/tasks.md","hash":"sha256:c216771b98ec73f516ff4e995c59c76e484dbd50a0ee0597e78406b7b3ac8ed1"},{"path":"specrunner/changes/graph-and-check/test-cases.md","hash":"sha256:e11e317db3d7171f88825e9eaa6a7ad4558b74ec7c9135780ae4983e187b68cb","required":false},{"path":".","hash":null}]}
